\[ \ell^2 = (7 + 2\sqrt{39.25})^2 = 7^2 + 2 \cdot 7 \cdot 2\sqrt{39.25} + (2\sqrt{39.25})^2 \]
\[ = 49 + 28\sqrt{39.25} + 4 \cdot 39.25 \]
\[ = 49 + 157 + 28\sqrt{39.25} \]
\[ = 206 + 28\sqrt{39.25} \]

